      "html": "<section class=\"ds-writing\"><input aria-label=\"标题\" placeholder=\"添加标题\"><textarea aria-label=\"正文\" placeholder=\"分享校园里的新鲜事\"></textarea></section>",
      "css": ".ds-writing{background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text)}.ds-writing input,.ds-writing textarea{display:block;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:var(--color-text);font:inherit;caret-color:var(--color-primary)}.ds-writing input{min-height:48px;padding:7px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.3px}.ds-writing textarea{min-height:152px;resize:none;padding:6px 0 16px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.ds-writing input::placeholder,.ds-writing textarea::placeholder{color:var(--color-muted)}.ds-writing input:focus,.ds-writing textarea:focus{outline:none;box-shadow:none}"
    },
    {
      "name": "首页局部 · 课程速览",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "首页局部布局，来源 src/home-dashboard.css 与 App.vue。静态预览显示默认折叠；应用内按钮可通过点击、Enter、Space 展开动态时间线，课程与学习入口保持同组。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-home-course\" aria-label=\"课程速览\"><button class=\"ds-home-focus\"><span class=\"ds-home-status\">下一节课</span><span class=\"ds-home-main\"><span class=\"ds-home-clock\"><time>11:15</time><small>至 12:00</small></span><span class=\"ds-home-copy\"><strong>课程名称</strong><small>教室 · 教师</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></button><div class=\"ds-home-timeline\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\">今日课程 · 收起状态</button><button>查看课表</button></div><div class=\"ds-home-study\"><button>学习通 <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><button>成绩与学业 <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-home-course{background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.ds-home-course button{border:0;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;color:inherit;background:transparent}.ds-home-focus{display:block;width:100%;padding:14px 16px;text-align:left;background:var(--color-highlight)!important}.ds-home-status{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--color-primary-strong)}.ds-home-main{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.ds-home-clock{display:grid;flex:0 0 auto;gap:3px;padding-right:14px;border-right:1px solid var(--color-border);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-home-clock time{font-size:26px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.15;color:var(--color-primary-strong)}.ds-home-course small{display:block;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--color-muted)}.ds-home-copy{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-home-copy strong{font-size:19px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.45;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-home-main>svg{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--color-primary)}.ds-home-timeline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-inline:16px}.ds-home-timeline button{min-height:44px;font-size:12px}.ds-home-timeline button+button{color:var(--color-primary)}.ds-home-study{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)}.ds-home-study button{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;min-height:48px;min-width:0;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-align:left}.ds-home-study button+button{border-left:1px solid var(--color-divider)}.ds-home-course button:hover{background:var(--color-highlight)}.ds-home-course button:active{background:var(--color-tint)!important;transform:none}.ds-home-course button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary);outline-offset:-3px}@media(max-width:374px){.ds-home-focus{padding-inline:14px}.ds-home-main{gap:10px}.ds-home-clock{padding-right:10px}.ds-home-clock time{font-size:24px}.ds-home-copy strong{font-size:18px}.ds-home-study button{padding-inline:14px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "首页局部 · 生活服务组",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "首页与复用生活服务视图的局部模式，来源 src/components/LifeServices.vue。完整72px操作行、0行圆角、16px外组；底部64px双列工具，应用显示真实缓存余额、上次查询及登录失效状态。此静态预览省略业务图标，展示未连接状态。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-home-services\" aria-label=\"校园生活\"><button class=\"ds-home-service-row\"><span class=\"ds-home-service-copy\"><strong>趣智校园</strong><small>洗澡 · 余额与充值</small></span><span class=\"ds-home-wallet\"><b>连接账户</b><small>去连接</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-home-service-row\"><span class=\"ds-home-service-copy\"><strong>胖乖生活</strong><small>饮水 · 洗衣 · 扫码</small></span><span class=\"ds-home-wallet\"><b>连接账户</b><small>去连接</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><div class=\"ds-home-tools\"><button><span><strong>取快递</strong><small>淘宝 · 拼多多出库码</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button><button><span><strong>校园平面图</strong><small>东区 · 西区</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-home-services{background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.ds-home-services button{display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-home-service-row{width:100%;gap:12px;min-height:72px;padding:12px 14px}.ds-home-service-row+.ds-home-service-row{border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)}.ds-home-service-copy{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-home-service-copy strong{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5}.ds-home-services small{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--color-muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-home-wallet{flex:0 1 auto;text-align:right;min-width:0}.ds-home-wallet b{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;color:var(--color-primary);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-home-wallet small{font-size:10px;margin-top:3px}.ds-home-services svg{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--color-muted)}.ds-home-tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--color-divider)}.ds-home-tools button{gap:9px;min-height:64px;padding:10px 14px}.ds-home-tools button+button{border-left:1px solid var(--color-divider)}.ds-home-tools button>span{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-home-tools strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}.ds-home-tools small{font-size:10px}.ds-home-services button:hover{background:var(--color-highlight)}.ds-home-services button:active{background:var(--color-highlight);transform:none}.ds-home-services button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary);outline-offset:-3px}@media(max-width:374px){.ds-home-service-row{padding-inline:12px;gap:9px}.ds-home-tools button{padding-inline:12px;gap:7px}}@media(min-width:540px){.ds-home-service-row{padding-inline:18px;gap:16px}.ds-home-service-copy small{font-size:12px}.ds-home-tools button{padding-inline:18px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "安静的校园工具",
    "overview": "中文校园工具，面向 Android 上频繁、短时、单手的查课、学习任务、生活服务与社区阅读。延续现有浅紫与白色品牌：白色承担阅读，淡紫承担分组和选中状态，小金鱼与校园横幅承担主要品牌表达。业务页面保持安静，层级来自正文、辅助文字、间距和细分隔。\n\n参考 Apple HIG 的层级、可读性、安全区域与直接操作，保留 Android 返回和系统控件。运行时令牌以 `src/tokens.css` 为准；`src/product.css` 在既有布局样式之后加载，共享语义值而保留领域布局。首页局部布局由其后加载的 `src/home-dashboard.css` 持有，校园横幅与生活服务分别由 `src/campus-home.css` 和 `src/components/LifeServices.vue` 持有。社区沿用相同语义令牌，编辑与阅读仍有局部排版。此记录来自当前代码及 Chromium 合成截图；2026-11-17 首页改版已获独立浏览器与源码审查 ship，详细范围见 `docs/home-redesign/DESIGN-RECORD.md`。未有获批视觉稿或原生截图，尚无本轮真机验收。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "白色阅读面与淡紫选中面。",
      "系统中文无衬线处理业务，宋体保留给横幅品牌。",
      "五 Tab 与既有二级页面结构稳定。",
      "静态分组平面化，浮层使用柔和深度。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Shared Palette Rule",
        "body": "首页和社区使用同一组语义颜色；局部排版不建立第二套主题。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Brand Type Rule",
        "body": "宋体只承担横幅品牌；业务标题、正文、输入和操作沿用系统无衬线。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Surface Rule",
        "body": "静态分组依靠色面和细边界；浮层深度不扩散为每张卡片的装饰。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 保留首页、课表、社区、待办、我的五 Tab、小金鱼、现有校园横幅和主题选择。",
      "Do 从运行时语义令牌取色，依内容层级选择正文、辅助文字和边界。",
      "Do 将主操作与图标实际触控区域做到至少 44px；允许文字、错误信息和表单随内容增高。",
      "Do 让长标题换行、数字按需等宽，并尊重安全区域与 reduced-motion。",
      "Do 保留真实加载、错误、空状态和恢复入口；截图使用合成数据时明确标注为测试。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 将所有卡片、按钮、分组统一改成胶囊，或用装饰卡片替代功能层级。",
      "Don't 将横幅品牌宋体扩散到业务正文，或为系统字体另行下载字体包。",
      "Don't 隐藏失败、用演示数据填充线上空状态，或改变接口、权限、存储键和数据格式。",
      "Don't 因记录设计而更改课表节次几何、草稿、返回位置或匿名与公开身份隔离。",
      "Don't 将现有小触控区域、特殊焦点覆盖或局部硬编码颜色推广为新页面默认值。"
    ]
  }
}
